      "id": 85718,
      "name": "dedlius",
      "username": "dedlius",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ccd318/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-06T23:42:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Vengeance is definitely going to be February. GSF is definitely going to be delayed a month or two beyond that. We'll post an update to the Kickstarter campaigns in the next week or two once we know the exact schedule on both.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For those of us non-playtesters eagerly awaiting GSF, here's hoping there's plenty of info both about the game and about why it is being delayed a second time.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:09:29.156Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
