      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Paul\"]\n\nVengeance is definitely going to be February. GSF is definitely going to be delayed a month or two beyond that. We&#39;ll post an update to the Kickstarter campaigns in the next week or two once we know the exact schedule on both.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nFor those of us non-playtesters eagerly awaiting GSF, here&#39;s hoping there&#39;s plenty of info both about the game and about why it is being delayed a second time.\n",
