      "created_at": "2014-01-07T00:33:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Not really delayed a second time. Just still in delay - Vengeance and GSF being at the same time was far more work than anticipated, and in order to properly deliver on GSF as a fully tested and formed game, work on it was put off till after Vengeance had been finished. Playtesting continues so a good exciting game can be delivered to everyone!</p>",
